  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Macaroni and cheese is a classic comfort dish made with tender noodles coated in a rich, creamy cheddar sauce. Butter, milk, and melty cheese come together to create a smooth, velvety texture with warm, nostalgic flavor in every bite. Easy to prepare with simple pantry ingredients, macaroni and cheese is the perfect cozy meal for family dinners, quick lunches, or anytime you’re craving homemade comfort food.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-macaroni-and-cheese\">Why You’ll Love This Macaroni and Cheese</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-macaroni-and-cheese\">How to Make Macaroni and Cheese</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-macaroni-and-cheese\">Pro Tips for Making Macaroni and Cheese</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-macaroni-and-cheese\">How to Serve this Macaroni and Cheese</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-macaroni-and-cheese\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Macaroni and Cheese</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It&#8217;s a creamy, dreamy dish that warms your heart.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick and easy to whip up for any occasion.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customizable with your favorite cheeses and add-ins.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect for kids and adults alike—everyone loves it!</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Leftovers? They taste even better the next day!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-12339\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"12339\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-pa